WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.890 --> 00:00:04.760
These updates to the percent Daily Value for
nutrients are definitely….

00:00:04.760 --> 00:00:06.819
…on trend!?

00:00:06.819 --> 00:00:07.859
Absolutely!

00:00:07.859 --> 00:00:13.120
The percent Daily Value shows how much a nutrient
in a serving of food contributes to a total

00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:14.120
daily diet.

00:00:14.120 --> 00:00:18.480
So, the percent Daily Value can show me if
a food is high or low in nutrients?

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:19.480
Yep!

00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:23.640
Just remember—five percent or less of the
Daily Value for a nutrient is considered low

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:27.110
and, twenty percent or more of the Daily Value
is considered high.

00:00:27.110 --> 00:00:29.839
This is going to fly off the shelves

00:00:29.839 --> 00:00:31.890
See what’s new…and what’s been updated.

00:00:31.890 --> 00:00:35.280
The new Nutrition Facts label…see what’s
in it for you at FDA.gov/NewNutritionFactsLabel.

